manufacturing technology, and automotive engineering."}, {"course_id": "MSRIT-MBA", "degree": "MBA / PGDM", "course_name": "Master of Business Administration (MBA)", "stream": "Management", "duration": "2 Years (4 Semesters)", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b91,50,000", "seats": 120, "median_salary": "\u20b96.20 LPA", "eligibility": "Graduation with 50% + Karnataka PGCET / KMAT / MAT", "overview": "Specializations in Marketing, Finance, Human Resource Management, and Business Analytics."}, {"course_id": "MSRIT-MCA", "degree": "MCA", "course_name": "Master of Computer Applications (MCA)", "stream": "IT & Software", "duration": "2 Years (4 Semesters)", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b91,40,000", "seats": 60, "median_salary": "\u20b96.50 LPA", "eligibility": "BCA / B.Sc / B.Com with Mathematics + Karnataka PGCET", "overview": "Enterprise software engineering, cloud native computing, mobile application frameworks, and machine learning."}, {"course_id": "MSRIT-BARCH", "degree": "B.Arch", "course_name": "Bachelor of Architecture (B.Arch)", "stream": "Architecture", "duration": "5 Years (10 Semesters)", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b94,50,000", "seats": 80, "median_salary": "\u20b95.50 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 50% in PCM + Valid NATA Score", "overview": "Architectural design studio, sustainable urban planning, structural building systems, and digital 3D drafting."}]}','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/87/Ramaiah_Institute_of_Technology_logo.svg/330px-Ramaiah_Institute_of_Technology_logo.svg.png','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562774053-701939374585?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','principal@msrit.edu','Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU), Belagavi','Autonomous Institute Affiliated to VTU, NAAC A+, NBA Accredited','Gnanagangothri Campus, MSR Nagar',1,'https://maps.google.com/?q=Ramaiah+Institute+of+Technology+Bengaluru','{"introduction": "Ramaiah Institute of Technology (MSRIT) was founded in 1962 by the late philanthropist Dr. M. S. Ramaiah. It is recognized as one of India''s premier autonomous engineering institutions, fostering innovation, engineering rigor, and ethical professional practice.", "history": "Established in 1962 with only 2 departments, MSRIT has grown across six decades into a vibrant multi-disciplinary academic hub comprising 17 undergraduate engineering branches and multiple postgraduate research centers.", "vision": "To be an Institution of International Eminence, renowned for imparting quality and value-based education in Engineering & Technology with emphasis on research and societal engagement.", "mission": ["Provide state-of-the-art infrastructure and environment for quality education.", "Strengthen research capabilities and industry-academia collaborations.", "Inculcate high moral and ethical values among students and faculty members."], "educational_philosophy": "Outcome-Based Education (OBE) adhering to Washington Accord guidelines, focusing on experiential learning, design thinking, and multidisciplinary capstone engineering projects.", "teaching_methodology": "Blended learning with lecture-capture systems, digital flip-classrooms, laboratory simulations, and industry co-mentored curriculum modules.", "academic_environment": "Vibrant campus culture with 45+ technical and cultural clubs, IEEE and ACM student branches, and an active Atal Incubation Centre."}','{"classrooms": {"available": true, "count": 128, "description": "Acoustically treated smart lecture halls with ultra-short-throw projectors and lecture recording systems."}, "science_labs": {"available": true, "count": 32, "description": "Dedicated Applied Physics, Materials Chemistry, and Environmental Engineering laboratories."}, "computer_labs": {"available": true, "count": 42, "description": "High-performance computing clusters with NVIDIA GPU workstations and 1,800+ dual-boot workstations."}, "library": {"available": true, "details": "Central automated library with 145,000+ print volumes, IEEE Xplore, ScienceDirect, and 24/7 digital repository."}, "digital_learning": {"available": true, "details": "Campus-wide Moodle LMS, lecture capture suites, and institutional Coursera/NPTEL local chapters."}, "sports": {"available": true, "details": "Full-size football ground, floodlit basketball & tennis courts, air-conditioned badminton hall, and fitness center."}, "auditorium": {"available": true, "count": 4, "details": "Apex Auditorium with 1,200 seats and 3 seminar halls with dolby audio and video conferencing."}, "cafeteria": {"available": true, "details": "Three multi-cuisine hygienic canteens serving vegetarian and non-vegetarian fare with strict FSSAI quality audits."}, "medical_room": {"available": true, "details": "Ramaiah Memorial Hospital adjacent medical center with dedicated 24/7 doctors, nurses, and ambulance on standby."}, "internet": {"available": true, "speed": "1 Gbps dedicated symmetric leased line, Wi-Fi 6 coverage across all academic blocks and hostels."}, "accessibility": {"available": true, "features": ["Wheelchair accessible ramps at all block entrances", "Elevators in all multistory wings", "Braille signage", "Accessible washrooms"]}, "security": {"available": true, "features": ["24/7 CCTV surveillance with 450+ IP cameras", "Biometric and RFID campus entry gates", "Fire detection and automated sprinkler networks"]}}','{"available": true, "boys_capacity": 1850, "girls_capacity": 1250, "food_details": "Spacious mechanized kitchens providing nutritious South and North Indian meals with weekly special menus.", "amenities": ["High-speed Wi-Fi in each room", "RO purified drinking water", "Solar water heating", "In-house laundry service", "Gymnasium and reading lounge"], "supervision": "Chief Warden with resident faculty wardens on each floor, 24/7 security personnel, and biometric biometric attendance checks.", "contact_phone": "+91-80-2360-6934"}','{"available": true, "fleet_size": 28, "gps_enabled": true, "routes": [{"route_number": "Route 1", "origin": "Majestic Bus Station", "stops": ["Malleshwaram", "Yeshwanthpur", "Mathikere", "Campus"], "pickup_time": "07:30 AM"}, {"route_number": "Route 2", "origin": "Whitefield", "stops": ["KR Puram", "Tin Factory", "Kasturi Nagar", "Hebbal", "Campus"], "pickup_time": "07:05 AM"}, {"route_number": "Route 3", "origin": "Jayanagar 4th Block", "stops": ["Lalbagh", "Corporation", "Shivajinagar", "Mekhri Circle", "Campus"], "pickup_time": "07:15 AM"}, {"route_number": "Route 4", "origin": "Kengeri Satellite Town", "stops": ["Nagarbhavi", "Vijayanagar", "Rajajinagar", "Mahalaxmi Layout", "Campus"], "pickup_time": "07:10 AM"}], "transport_coordinator": "Transport Officer, Phone: +91-80-2360-7711"}','{"academic_year": "2026-2027", "status": "Admissions Counseling Open", "eligibility_criteria": "Pass in 10+2 / Karnataka 2nd PUC with Physics & Mathematics as compulsory subjects and minimum 45% aggregate (40% for SC/ST/OBC). Selection via KCET / COMEDK UGET.", "process_steps": ["Step 1: Appear for KCET or COMEDK competitive entrance examinations.", "Step 2: Attend state centralized counseling and select Ramaiah Institute of Technology.", "Step 3: Verification of original certificates and admission letter issuance.", "Step 4: Institutional document submission and fee remittance."], "scholarships": ["MSRIT Merit Scholarship for state rank holders (KCET Rank < 1000).", "Post-Matric Govt of Karnataka SSP and NSP scholarship schemes.", "Merit-cum-Means financial assistance provided by Gokula Education Foundation."], "required_documents": ["KCET / COMEDK Rank Card and Allotment Letter", "10th Standard Marks Card (Proof of Date of Birth)", "12th / 2nd PUC Marks Sheet", "Study and Conduct Certificates (7 years in Karnataka for KCET)", "Transfer Certificate and Migration Certificate", "Caste / Income Certificate (if applicable)"]}','Degree Colleges',13.0312,77.5651);
INSERT INTO schools VALUES('COL002','R.V. College of Engineering (RVCE)','Bengaluru Urban','Karnataka','Degree College','Mysore Road, RV Vidyaniketan Post, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560059',1963,'Consistently recognized as Karnataka''s topmost autonomous private engineering institution with stellar placement records and research output.','+91-80-6818-8100','https://www.rvce.edu.in','{"institution_category": "Engineering College", "affiliation": "Autonomous, Affiliated to VTU", "naac_grade": "A+ Grade (3.32 CGPA)", "nirf_rank": "#96 in Engineering (NIRF 2024)", "accreditation": "AICTE, NBA Accredited", "rating": "4.4 / 5 (380 Reviews)", "tuition_fees_range": "\u20b94.10 L - \u20b912.0 L", "median_package": "\u20b910.5 LPA", "highest_package": "\u20b962.0 LPA", "total_courses_count": 35, "top_recruiters": ["Microsoft", "Google", "Amazon", "Goldman Sachs", "Cisco", "Bosch", "Intel", "Morgan Stanley"], "campus_facilities": ["Separate Hostels", "Central Research Facility", "Robotics Lab", "Badminton Arena", "Air-conditioned Seminar Halls", "Cafeteria Complex"], "admissions": {"accepted_exams": ["KCET", "COMEDK UGET", "Karnataka PGCET", "GATE"], "eligibility": "Passed 10+2 with 45% aggregate in PCM with valid KCET/COMEDK rank."}, "courses": [{"course_id": "RVCE-BE-CSE", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.E. in Computer Science and Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b94,12,000", "seats": 240, "median_salary": "\u20b911.2 LPA", "eligibility": "KCET Top 500 / COMEDK Top 400", "overview": "Flagship engineering curriculum with specialized tracks in AI, Cybersecurity, and Distributed Cloud Computing."}, {"course_id": "RVCE-BE-ECE", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.E. in Electronics and Communication Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b94,12,000", "seats": 180, "median_salary": "\u20b99.8 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "State-of-the-art semiconductor physics, VLSI circuit design, embedded robotics, and wireless 5G communications."}, {"course_id": "RVCE-BE-AEROSPACE", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.E. in Aerospace Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b94,12,000", "seats": 60, "median_salary": "\u20b98.5 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "Aerodynamics, flight mechanics, propulsion systems, aircraft structures, and satellite subsystems."}, {"course_id": "RVCE-MTECH-VLSI", "degree": "M.Tech", "course_name": "M.Tech in VLSI Design & Embedded Systems", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "2 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b91,50,000", "seats": 36, "median_salary": "\u20b99.5 LPA", "eligibility": "B.E. / B.Tech with 50% + GATE / PGCET", "overview": "Deep focus on physical chip design, ASIC methodologies, verification architectures, and FPGA prototyping."}]}','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d4/RVCE_New_Logo.svg/330px-RVCE_New_Logo.svg.png','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541339907198-e08756dedf3f?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','principal@rvce.edu.in','Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU), Belagavi','Autonomous Institution Affiliated to VTU, AICTE Approved, NAAC A+','RV Vidyaniketan, Mysore Road Campus',1,'https://maps.google.com/?q=RV+College+of+Engineering+Bengaluru','{"introduction": "R.V. College of Engineering (RVCE) was established in 1963 by Rashtreeya Sikshana Samithi Trust (RSST). RVCE is universally acclaimed as one of the country''s preeminent engineering colleges, renowned for world-class student technical projects, Formula Bharat teams, and satellite design teams.", "history": "Starting with 3 core branches in 1963, RVCE today spans over 50 acres on Mysore Road, offering 15 undergraduate, 14 postgraduate, and doctoral research programs with over 7,000 active scholars.", "vision": "Leadership in Quality Technical Education, Interdisciplinary Research & Innovation, with a Focus on Sustainable and Inclusive Technology.", "mission": ["Deliver outcome-based engineering education integrated with ethical, social and human values.", "Promote interdisciplinary research in clean energy, aerospace, IoT, and artificial intelligence.", "Partner with global industries to foster entrepreneurship and sustainable solutions."], "educational_philosophy": "Hands-on engineering learning backed by real-world problem statements, student project competitions (Team Ashwa, Team Chimera, Team Solar Car), and continuous internal evaluation.", "teaching_methodology": "Interactive lectures, design thinking workshops, multi-disciplinary labs, and mandatory industrial internships.", "academic_environment": "State-of-the-art research centers of excellence funded by DST, ISRO, and multinational corporate labs (Cisco, Bosch, Samsung)."}','{"classrooms": {"available": true, "count": 140, "description": "Multimedia-equipped interactive lecture theaters with ergonomic acoustic seating."}, "science_labs": {"available": true, "count": 36, "description": "Advanced Physics, Nano-Materials, and Polymer Chemistry laboratories."}, "computer_labs": {"available": true, "count": 50, "description": "High-performance compute clusters, AI supercomputing server rack, and 2,200 networked terminals."}, "library": {"available": true, "details": "Central library spanning 4 floors with 160,000+ volumes, IEEE, ACM, Springer Nature digital subscriptions, and 24/7 digital hub."}, "digital_learning": {"available": true, "details": "Canvas LMS, smart lecture-capture facilities, and digital studio for faculty video content creation."}, "sports": {"available": true, "details": "Cricket and football grounds, 400m synthetic running track, indoor gymnasium, tennis and basketball courts."}, "auditorium": {"available": true, "count": 3, "details": "Sir M. Visvesvaraya Auditorium seating 1,000 participants and 2 AC seminar halls."}, "cafeteria": {"available": true, "details": "Two multi-story food courts with dedicated continental, South Indian, and diet counters."}, "medical_room": {"available": true, "details": "Campus Health Centre with resident physician, emergency observation beds, and round-the-clock ambulance."}, "internet": {"available": true, "speed": "2 Gbps multi-redundant fiber optic connection, campus-wide enterprise Wi-Fi."}, "accessibility": {"available": true, "features": ["Step-free campus paths", "Hydraulic lifts across all departments", "Accessible parking bays", "Tactile guidance"]}, "security": {"available": true, "features": ["Campus CCTV surveillance with 500+ cameras", "RFID vehicle boom barriers", "Professional security perimeter"]}}','{"available": true, "boys_capacity": 2100, "girls_capacity": 1400, "food_details": "Hygienic steam kitchens preparing vegetarian and non-vegetarian menus under nutritionist supervision.", "amenities": ["Individual Wi-Fi access points", "Solar hot water 24/7", "Recreation room with table tennis & chess", "Laundry facilities", "Reading library"], "supervision": "Senior faculty warden cadre, resident deputy wardens, 24/7 security watch, and biometric biometric check-ins.", "contact_phone": "+91-80-6818-8188"}','{"available": true, "fleet_size": 32, "gps_enabled": true, "routes": [{"route_number": "Route 1", "origin": "Yelahanka New Town", "stops": ["Hebbal", "Mekhri Circle", "Rajajinagar", "Vijayanagar", "RVCE"], "pickup_time": "06:50 AM"}, {"route_number": "Route 2", "origin": "Sarjapur Road", "stops": ["HSR Layout", "Silk Board", "BTM Layout", "Banashankari", "RVCE"], "pickup_time": "07:00 AM"}, {"route_number": "Route 3", "origin": "Banashankari 3rd Stage", "stops": ["Kathriguppe", "PES College", "Nayanadahalli", "RVCE"], "pickup_time": "07:25 AM"}, {"route_number": "Route 4", "origin": "Kengeri Satellite Town", "stops": ["Kommaghatta", "Kengeri Bus Stand", "RVCE"], "pickup_time": "07:40 AM"}], "transport_coordinator": "Transport Officer, Phone: +91-80-6818-8255"}','{"academic_year": "2026-2027", "status": "Admissions Counseling Open", "eligibility_criteria": "Minimum 45% aggregate marks in 10+2 / 2nd PUC with Physics, Mathematics and Chemistry/Electronics. Merit admission via KCET, COMEDK, and institutional quota.", "process_steps": ["Step 1: Qualify in Karnataka CET or COMEDK entrance exams.", "Step 2: Participate in online option entry and seat allocation.", "Step 3: Document verification at college admissions office.", "Step 4: Formal enrollment, biometric ID issuance, and orientation."], "scholarships": ["RSST Merit Scholarship for state rank holders (KCET Rank < 500).", "Alumni Association Endowment Scholarships for deserving scholars.", "Post-Matric National and State Scholarship portal schemes."], "required_documents": ["KEA / COMEDK Allotment Order and Rank Sheet", "10th and 12th Standard Original Mark Sheets", "7 Years Karnataka Study Certificate (for KCET)", "Transfer & Migration Certificates", "Medical Fitness Certificate", "Aadhaar Card and 5 Passport Photos"]}','Degree Colleges',12.9237,77.4987);
INSERT INTO schools VALUES('COL003','BMS College of Engineering (BMSCE)','Bengaluru Urban','Karnataka','Degree College','Bull Temple Road, Basavanagudi, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560019',1946,'The first private engineering college in India, established by Bhusanayana Mukundadas Sreenivasaiah. Historic institution with NAAC A++ accreditation.','+91-80-2662-2130','https://www.bmsce.ac.in','{"institution_category": "Engineering College", "affiliation": "Autonomous, Affiliated to VTU", "naac_grade": "A++ Grade (3.83 CGPA)", "nirf_rank": "#101 in Engineering (NIRF 2024)", "accreditation": "AICTE Approved, NBA Accredited Tier-1", "rating": "4.3 / 5 (320 Reviews)", "tuition_fees_range": "\u20b93.86 L - \u20b911.0 L", "median_package": "\u20b98.24 LPA", "highest_package": "\u20b952.0 LPA", "total_courses_count": 32, "top_recruiters": ["Oracle", "Qualcomm", "Siemens", "TCS", "Accenture", "Dell", "Mercedes-Benz R&D"], "campus_facilities": ["Hostel Facilities", "Data Center", "Mechanical Workshops", "Cultural Amphitheatre", "Sports Arena", "Health Center"], "admissions": {"accepted_exams": ["KCET", "COMEDK UGET", "Karnataka PGCET"], "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM (40% for reserved category) + KCET or COMEDK rank."}, "courses": [{"course_id": "BMSCE-BE-CSE", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.E. in Computer Science and Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b93,86,296", "seats": 240, "median_salary": "\u20b98.5 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "Strong foundation in data structures, algorithms, machine learning, systems architecture, and mobile engineering."}, {"course_id": "BMSCE-BE-CIVIL", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.E. in Civil Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b93,86,296", "seats": 120, "median_salary": "\u20b96.0 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "Structural analysis, geotechnical engineering, environmental engineering, GIS surveying, and transportation planning."}, {"course_id": "BMSCE-MBA", "degree": "MBA / PGDM", "course_name": "Master of Business Administration (MBA)", "stream": "Management", "duration": "2 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b91,40,000", "seats": 120, "median_salary": "\u20b96.5 LPA", "eligibility": "Graduation with 50% + PGCET / KMAT", "overview": "Curriculum focused on strategic consulting, digital marketing, corporate finance, and operations management."}]}','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f6/B.M.S._College_of_Engineering_logo.png/330px-B.M.S._College_of_Engineering_logo.png','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','principal@bmsce.ac.in','Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU), Belagavi','Autonomous College Affiliated to VTU, AICTE Approved, NAAC A++','Basavanagudi Historic Campus',1,'https://maps.google.com/?q=BMS+College+of+Engineering+Basavanagudi','{"introduction": "Founded in 1946 by the great visionary and philanthropist Dharmaprakasha Rajakaryaprasakta B. M. Sreenivasaiah, BMS College of Engineering is India''s first private sector engineering college. Located in the cultural heart of Bengaluru at Basavanagudi, it holds the prestigious NAAC A++ accreditation.", "history": "With over 78 years of illustrious history, BMSCE has trained generations of engineers, technology leaders, and public figures who have shaped global enterprises and national research institutions.", "vision": "Promoting Prosperity of Mankind by augmenting human resource capital through Quality Technical Education & Training.", "mission": ["Accomplish excellence in Engineering, Management and Research through academic rigor.", "Nurture innovation, entrepreneurship and ethical values among the youth.", "Foster collaboration with premier global universities and research consortiums."], "educational_philosophy": "Outcome-Based Education with high emphasis on fundamental engineering concepts, laboratory innovation, and multidisciplinary community problem solving.", "teaching_methodology": "Project-based learning, industry-immersed electives, flipped classrooms, and hackathons.", "academic_environment": "Vibrant campus culture with BMS Phase 2 & 3 state-of-the-art academic towers, IEEE, ASME, and UTSAV cultural festival."}','{"classrooms": {"available": true, "count": 135, "description": "Smart air-conditioned classrooms with interactive smartboards and digital lecture recording."}, "science_labs": {"available": true, "count": 30, "description": "Modern laboratories for Physics, Chemistry, and Nanotechnology research."}, "computer_labs": {"available": true, "count": 45, "description": "State-of-the-art computing centers with high-end workstations and dedicated AI/ML computing clusters."}, "library": {"available": true, "details": "Modern multi-floor library with 170,000+ volumes, IEEE, ASCE, ASME digital portals, and automated RFID return kiosks."}, "digital_learning": {"available": true, "details": "Google Classroom & Moodle LMS integration, lecture capture studios, and digital examination platform."}, "sports": {"available": true, "details": "Multipurpose sports complex with basketball, volleyball courts, badminton arena, and fitness gymnasium."}, "auditorium": {"available": true, "count": 3, "details": "B.M. Sreenivasaiah Platinum Jubilee Auditorium with 1,500 seats and cutting-edge acoustics."}, "cafeteria": {"available": true, "details": "Hygienic multi-cuisine food court offering diverse South Indian, North Indian, and beverage counters."}, "medical_room": {"available": true, "details": "Campus health center with full-time medical officer, nursing care, and tie-up with nearby tertiary hospitals."}, "internet": {"available": true, "speed": "1.5 Gbps redundant fiber backbone with campus-wide secure Wi-Fi."}, "accessibility": {"available": true, "features": ["Wheelch