ractical lab training in molecular biology, plant tissue culture, bio-analytical chemistry, and genomics."}]}','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/91/Mount_Carmel_College%2C_Bangalore_logo.png/330px-Mount_Carmel_College%2C_Bangalore_logo.png','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','mcc@mccblr.edu.in','Bengaluru City University','UGC Autonomous, NAAC A+ (Fourth Cycle), Bengaluru City University Affiliated','Vasanth Nagar Heritage Campus',0,'https://maps.google.com/?q=Mount+Carmel+College+Bengaluru','{"introduction": "Mount Carmel College (MCC), Autonomous, Bengaluru, is an elite women''s higher education institution founded in 1948 by the Sisters of the Congregation of the Carmelite Religious. MCC has been at the forefront of women''s empowerment and leadership in India for over 75 years.", "history": "Inaugurated in 1948 with 53 students, MCC has blossomed into an institution educating over 9,000 women across humanities, commerce, science, and fashion technology.", "vision": "Empowerment of women through holistic education, critical inquiry, and global social engagement.", "mission": ["Foster academic excellence and intellectual leadership among women scholars.", "Instill ethical values, social justice, and environmental consciousness.", "Prepare graduates for impactful global careers and entrepreneurial breakthroughs."], "educational_philosophy": "Holistic pedagogy integrating academic rigor, fine arts, leadership development, and societal empathy.", "teaching_methodology": "Interactive lectures, studio-based learning, business case studies, science laboratory projects, and international exchange programs.", "academic_environment": "Beautiful lush green campus in the heart of Vasanth Nagar, featuring modern academic complexes, botanical garden, and cultural festival ''Cul-Ah''."}','{"classrooms": {"available": true, "count": 105, "description": "Well-lit and ventilated smart classrooms with digital projection facilities."}, "science_labs": {"available": true, "count": 25, "description": "Modern Biotechnology, Biochemistry, Food Science, and Fashion Designing studios."}, "computer_labs": {"available": true, "count": 18, "description": "Advanced computing labs with high-speed internet, statistics, and business simulation software."}, "library": {"available": true, "details": "Three-floor automated library holding 125,000+ books, e-journals via N-LIST and DELNET, and quiet research cubicles."}, "digital_learning": {"available": true, "details": "Institutional Moodle portal, lecture capture rooms, and video conference facilities."}, "sports": {"available": true, "details": "Floodlit basketball court, volleyball court, indoor sports center, and modern fitness gym."}, "auditorium": {"available": true, "count": 2, "details": "Golden Jubilee Auditorium seating 1,100 attendees and Mother Veronica Hall."}, "cafeteria": {"available": true, "details": "Hygienic multi-cuisine cafeteria offering healthy meals, bakery snacks, and fresh beverages."}, "medical_room": {"available": true, "details": "Infirmary with full-time resident nursing staff and emergency physician visits."}, "internet": {"available": true, "speed": "1 Gbps dedicated high-speed leased line with campus-wide Wi-Fi."}, "accessibility": {"available": true, "features": ["Wheelchair ramps across main blocks", "Lifts in high-rise buildings", "Specially designed restrooms"]}, "security": {"available": true, "features": ["24/7 security watch with 320+ CCTV surveillance cameras", "Strict campus visitor gating protocols"]}}','{"available": true, "boys_capacity": 0, "girls_capacity": 850, "food_details": "Strictly hygienic vegetarian and non-vegetarian meals prepared in in-house mechanized kitchens.", "amenities": ["24/7 Wi-Fi", "Solar water heating", "Study halls", "Recreation room", "In-house laundry service"], "supervision": "Resident Sisters and wardens, round-the-clock female security personnel, and biometric evening sign-ins.", "contact_phone": "+91-80-2226-1765"}','{"available": false, "fleet_size": 0, "gps_enabled": false, "routes": [], "transport_coordinator": "Centrally located on Palace Road with direct BMTC bus access and proximity to Bangalore Cantonment Station."}','{"academic_year": "2026-2027", "status": "Admissions Portal Open", "eligibility_criteria": "Pass in 10+2 / 2nd PUC with required marks for chosen discipline. Selection based on merit and entrance tests for specialized courses.", "process_steps": ["Step 1: Fill out the online application form on the MCC website.", "Step 2: Attend entrance assessment / interview (if applicable for the course).", "Step 3: Publication of selection lists on portal.", "Step 4: Document verification and fee settlement."], "scholarships": ["Carmel Merit-cum-Means Scholarships for deserving women students.", "Post-Matric Government of Karnataka and Central Sector Scholarships.", "Sports excellence fee concessions."], "required_documents": ["10th and 12th Marks Sheets", "Transfer Certificate from previous institution", "Migration Certificate (for non-Karnataka boards)", "Aadhaar Card copy and recent passport photos"]}','Degree Colleges',12.9904,77.5898);
INSERT INTO schools VALUES('COL008','KLE Technological University (BVBCET)','Dharwad','Karnataka','University','B.V. Bhoomaraddi Campus, Vidyanagar, Hubballi, Karnataka 580031',1947,'Leading technological university in North Karnataka renowned for innovation, robotics, product design, and entrepreneurial incubation.','+91-836-237-8101','https://www.kletech.ac.in','{"institution_category": "University", "affiliation": "State Private University Established under Karnataka Act No. 22 of 2013", "naac_grade": "A Grade", "nirf_rank": "#151-200 in Engineering", "accreditation": "AICTE Approved, NBA Tier-1", "rating": "4.2 / 5 (240 Reviews)", "tuition_fees_range": "\u20b93.5 L - \u20b99.0 L", "median_package": "\u20b96.8 LPA", "highest_package": "\u20b943.0 LPA", "total_courses_count": 28, "top_recruiters": ["Robert Bosch", "Sony India", "Tata Motors", "Mercedes-Benz", "Infosys", "Continental AG"], "campus_facilities": ["Hostels for 2500+ Students", "Center of Excellence in Robotics", "IoT Laboratory", "Makerspace Hub", "Convention Center"], "admissions": {"accepted_exams": ["KCET", "COMEDK UGET", "KLEEE"], "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM."}, "courses": [{"course_id": "KLE-BE-ROBOTICS", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.Tech in Robotics and Automation", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b93,80,000", "seats": 60, "median_salary": "\u20b97.2 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "Multidisciplinary program blending mechanical kinematics, microcontrollers, computer vision, and ROS simulation."}, {"course_id": "KLE-BE-CSE", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b93,80,000", "seats": 240, "median_salary": "\u20b97.5 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "Advanced software design, algorithms, cybersecurity architectures, and cloud enterprise engineering."}]}','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f0/KLE_Technological_University_logo.png/330px-KLE_Technological_University_logo.png','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562774053-701939374585?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','info@kletech.ac.in','KLE Technological University Act, State Private University (UGC Recognized)','State Private University (Karnataka Act 22 of 2013), UGC Recognized, NBA Tier-1','Vidyanagar Campus, Hubballi',1,'https://maps.google.com/?q=KLE+Technological+University+Hubballi','{"introduction": "KLE Technological University (formerly B.V. Bhoomaraddi College of Engineering & Technology - BVBCET) was established in 1947 in Hubballi, North Karnataka. Renowned for its transformative educational reforms, Center for Technology Innovation & Entrepreneurship (CTIE), and Make in India startup incubators.", "history": "Established under the leadership of the Karnataka Lingayat Education (KLE) Society in 1947, it transformed into a state university in 2015, spanning 64 acres in the industrial heartland of Hubballi-Dharwad.", "vision": "To be a leader in technical education and research that transforms lives and drives regional industrial economic development.", "mission": ["Provide experiential learning pedagogy fostering critical thinking and design capability.", "Nurture an ecosystem of entrepreneurship, startup ventures, and industrial patents.", "Serve regional and global communities through sustainable technological innovations."], "educational_philosophy": "Transformative student-centric engineering education with course projects, minor degree tracks, and live industry collaborations.", "teaching_methodology": "Project-based curriculum, problem-driven engineering workshops, design studios, and product commercialization mentoring.", "academic_environment": "Dynamic 64-acre green campus equipped with CTIE incubation hub housing 40+ hardware startups, robotics labs, and athletic grounds."}','{"classrooms": {"available": true, "count": 115, "description": "Acoustically engineered smart lecture rooms with multimedia interactive presentation displays."}, "science_labs": {"available": true, "count": 26, "description": "Well-equipped Physics, Chemistry, and Advanced Materials testing labs."}, "computer_labs": {"available": true, "count": 38, "description": "Over 1,600 high-performance computer terminals, cloud simulation servers, and VLSI design labs."}, "library": {"available": true, "details": "Automated central library holding 130,000+ volumes, IEEE digital access, and digital discussion rooms."}, "digital_learning": {"available": true, "details": "Contineo University ERP and online learning portals with video lecture repositories."}, "sports": {"available": true, "details": "Full cricket stadium, football ground, synthetic basketball courts, and multi-gymnasium."}, "auditorium": {"available": true, "count": 2, "details": "KLE Tech International Auditorium seating 1,200 and Senate Conference Hall."}, "cafeteria": {"available": true, "details": "Modern food court providing nutritious North Karnataka, South Indian, and continental dining options."}, "medical_room": {"available": true, "details": "On-campus health center staffed by KLES Hospital doctors with emergency care facilities."}, "internet": {"available": true, "speed": "1 Gbps high-capacity leased lines with campus-wide secure Wi-Fi access."}, "accessibility": {"available": true, "features": ["Wheelchair ramps across all academic blocks", "Elevator access in new academic towers", "Accessible restrooms"]}, "security": {"available": true, "features": ["24/7 CCTV surveillance with 350+ cameras", "Gated campus entry checkpoints"]}}','{"available": true, "boys_capacity": 1600, "girls_capacity": 1100, "food_details": "Hygienic vegetarian and non-vegetarian mess facilities serving nutritious regional and multi-state cuisines.", "amenities": ["High-speed Wi-Fi", "Solar water heating", "Study halls", "Indoor gym", "Laundry machines"], "supervision": "Resident faculty wardens on duty, 24/7 security watch, and biometric sign-in registers.", "contact_phone": "+91-836-237-8222"}','{"available": true, "fleet_size": 16, "gps_enabled": true, "routes": [{"route_number": "Route 1", "origin": "Dharwad Old Bus Stand", "stops": ["Toll Naka", "Navanagar", "Bairidevarkoppa", "KLE Tech"], "pickup_time": "07:20 AM"}, {"route_number": "Route 2", "origin": "Keshwapur Hubballi", "stops": ["Deshpande Nagar", "Chennamma Circle", "Vidyanagar", "KLE Tech"], "pickup_time": "07:35 AM"}], "transport_coordinator": "KLE Tech Transport Division, Phone: +91-836-237-8300"}','{"academic_year": "2026-2027", "status": "Admissions Counseling Open", "eligibility_criteria": "Minimum 45% aggregate in 10+2 / 2nd PUC with Physics & Mathematics. Selection via KCET / COMEDK.", "process_steps": ["Step 1: Appear for Karnataka CET or COMEDK competitive entrance tests.", "Step 2: Participate in counseling and select KLE Technological University.", "Step 3: Document verification and seat allotment at campus.", "Step 4: Formal admission and welcome orientation."], "scholarships": ["KLE Society Founder''s Merit Scholarships.", "Post-Matric Govt of Karnataka SSP and NSP scholarships.", "Startup incubation seed grants for student entrepreneurs."], "required_documents": ["KEA / COMEDK Allotment Order and Rank Card", "10th and 12th Standard Original Mark Sheets", "Study and Domicile Certificates", "Transfer Certificate", "Aadhaar Card and 4 Passport Photos"]}','Universities',15.3686,75.1219);
INSERT INTO schools VALUES('COL009','University of Mysore (Manasagangotri)','Mysuru','Karnataka','University','Manasagangotri, Mysuru, Karnataka 570006',1916,'The first university in Karnataka and sixth in India, established by Maharaja Krishnaraja Wadiyar IV. Century-old center of supreme academic excellence.','+91-821-241-9363','https://www.uni-mysore.ac.in','{"institution_category": "University", "affiliation": "State Public University Established 1916", "naac_grade": "A Grade (3.08 CGPA)", "nirf_rank": "#44 Among Indian Universities (NIRF 2024)", "accreditation": "UGC Recognized, AIU Member", "rating": "4.3 / 5 (410 Reviews)", "tuition_fees_range": "\u20b940,000 - \u20b92.5 L", "median_package": "\u20b95.0 LPA", "highest_package": "\u20b916.0 LPA", "total_courses_count": 85, "top_recruiters": ["ISRO", "DRDO", "CFTRI", "Wipro", "TCS", "Cognizant", "Cipla"], "campus_facilities": ["Historic Manasagangotri Campus", "Central Oriental Research Institute", "University Library", "Sports Pavilion", "Guest House"], "admissions": {"accepted_exams": ["PGEET", "Karnataka PGCET", "UOM Post-Graduate Entrance Exam"], "eligibility": "Relevant bachelor''s degree with 45% minimum marks."}, "courses": [{"course_id": "UOM-MSC-CS", "degree": "M.Sc", "course_name": "M.Sc in Computer Science", "stream": "Science", "duration": "2 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b960,000", "seats": 60, "median_salary": "\u20b95.5 LPA", "eligibility": "B.Sc with Computer Science / Mathematics", "overview": "Advanced computational logic, artificial intelligence, operating systems, and image processing."}, {"course_id": "UOM-MA-ECON", "degree": "M.A.", "course_name": "M.A. in Economics & Public Policy", "stream": "Humanities", "duration": "2 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b935,000", "seats": 80, "median_salary": "\u20b94.5 LPA", "eligibility": "Bachelor''s degree with Economics", "overview": "Econometrics, macroeconomic policy, Indian developmental economics, and public finance."}]}','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e9/University_of_Mysore_logo.png/330px-University_of_Mysore_logo.png','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541339907198-e08756dedf3f?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','registrar@uni-mysore.ac.in','Public State University (Established 1916, UGC Act 12B Recognized)','First University in Karnataka (Est. 1916), NAAC A Grade, UGC Centre of Excellence','Manasagangotri Heritage Campus (700+ Acres)',1,'https://maps.google.com/?q=University+of+Mysore+Manasagangotri','{"introduction": "The University of Mysore, established in 1916 by the visionary Maharaja Nalwadi Krishnaraja Wadiyar and Sir M. Visvesvaraya, is the sixth oldest university in India and the first in the state of Karnataka. Its historic 739-acre postgraduate campus, ''Manasagangotri'' (Fountainhead of the Mind), is situated alongside the picturesque Kukkarahalli Lake.", "history": "Over its 110-year history, the University has produced stalwarts of Indian letters, science, and governance, including Dr. S. Radhakrishnan, Kuvempu, and R. K. Narayan. It holds the prestigious ''University with Potential for Excellence'' and NAAC A++ recognitions.", "vision": "To be an internationally acclaimed university excelling in teaching, multidisciplinary research, and community extension services.", "mission": ["Provide inclusive, high-quality higher education accessible to all sections of society.", "Foster high-impact fundamental research in sciences, humanities, and social sciences.", "Preserve and promote regional literature, art, cultural heritage, and biodiversity."], "educational_philosophy": "Holistic academic inquiry grounded in truth, rational thought, public service, and academic freedom.", "teaching_methodology": "Postgraduate seminars, field explorations, advanced laboratory experiments, and doctoral dissertation mentorship.", "academic_environment": "Expansive 739-acre campus with 60+ postgraduate academic departments, Kuvempu Institute of Kannada Studies, National Centre for Science Research, and scenic nature trails."}','{"classrooms": {"available": true, "count": 160, "description": "Classic and modernized lecture halls with interactive multimedia teaching tools."}, "science_labs": {"available": true, "count": 55, "description": "National Centers of Excellence labs: Molecular Biology, Organic Chemistry, Physics, and Earth Sciences."}, "computer_labs": {"available": true, "count": 25, "description": "Central computer facility and departmental networked computer suites with 1,200+ terminals."}, "library": {"available": true, "details": "Manasagangotri Central Library with 650,000+ volumes, rare palm-leaf manuscripts, and comprehensive e-journal access."}, "digital_learning": {"available": true, "details": "Educational Multimedia Research Centre (EMMRC) with professional video production suites and MOOC courses."}, "sports": {"available": true, "details": "University Oval Grounds, indoor sports complex, tennis courts, and university swimming pool."}, "auditorium": {"available": true, "count": 4, "details": "Crawford Hall (iconic convocation hall) and Bahadur Institute Auditorium."}, "cafeteria": {"available": true, "details": "Central student cafeteria and departmental canteens serving nutritious vegetarian meals."}, "medical_room": {"available": true, "details": "University Health Centre with resident physicians, emergency beds, and pharmacy."}, "internet": {"available": true, "speed": "1 Gbps National Knowledge Network (NKN) fiber link with Wi-Fi connectivity."}, "accessibility": {"available": true, "features": ["Wheelchair accessible pathways", "Ramps at main departmental buildings", "Specially equipped Braille library section"]}, "security": {"available": true, "features": ["24/7 security watch across the 739-acre campus perimeter", "CCTV coverage at all entry gates"]}}','{"available": true, "boys_capacity": 2500, "girls_capacity": 1800, "food_details": "Hygienic subsidized vegetarian and non-vegetarian student dining halls.", "amenities": ["Wi-Fi connectivity", "Solar water heating", "Reading rooms", "Sports facilities"], "supervision": "Faculty hostel wardens, 24/7 security guards, and hostel grievance redressal cell.", "contact_phone": "+91-821-241-9333"}','{"available": false, "fleet_size": 0, "gps_enabled": false, "routes": [], "transport_coordinator": "Campus transit served by eco-friendly battery buggies and direct Mysuru City KSRTC bus routes."}','{"academic_year": "2026-2027", "status": "PG Entrance Exams (PGET) Open", "eligibility_criteria": "Bachelor''s degree with minimum 45% aggregate (40% for SC/ST/Cat-I) in relevant discipline. Admission through University PG Entrance Exam.", "process_steps": ["Step 1: Submit online application on UoM PG admission portal.", "Step 2: Appear for Postgraduate Entrance Examination (PGET).", "Step 3: Centralized counseling and document verification.", "Step 4: Fee payment and enrollment in respective postgraduate department."], "scholarships": ["Government of Karnataka Post-Matric SSP/NSP Scholarships.", "University Research Fellowships for top doctoral scholars.", "Endowment cash prizes and medals for university rank holders."], "required_documents": ["Undergraduate Degree Marks Cards and Degree Certificate", "PGET Hall Ticket and Rank Card", "Transfer Certificate from previous college", "Caste / Category / Income Certificate", "Aadhaar Card copy and 4 passport size photos"]}','Universities',12.3117,76.6186);
INSERT INTO schools VALUES('COL010','Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU)','Belagavi','Karnataka','University','K.R. Road, V.V. Puram, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560004',1998,'Premier statutory state technical university in Karnataka established under the VTU Act 1994, headquartered in Jnana Sangama Belagavi.','+91-80-2661-5865','https://vtu.ac.in','{"institution_category": "Engineering College", "affiliation": "Affiliated to Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU)", "naac_grade": "A+ Grade", "nirf_rank": "Ranked in Top 200 Engineering Colleges", "accreditation": "AICTE Approved, NBA Accredited Programs", "rating": "4.1 / 5 (350 Reviews)", "tuition_fees_range": "\u20b93.86 L - \u20b910.0 L", "median_package": "\u20b97.2 LPA", "highest_package": "\u20b945.0 LPA", "total_courses_count": 26, "top_recruiters": ["Infosys", "Wipro", "TCS", "Accenture", "Mercedes-Benz", "Dell", "Robert Bosch"], "campus_facilities": ["Hostels for Boys & Girls", "High-Tech Computer Labs", "Auditorium", "V.V. Puram Campus Library", "Cafeteria"], "admissions": {"accepted_exams": ["KCET", "COMEDK UGET", "Karnataka PGCET"], "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in Physics and Mathematics."}, "courses": [{"course_id": "BIT-BE-CSE", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.E. in Computer Science and Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b93,86,296", "seats": 180, "median_salary": "\u20b97.5 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "Rigorous engineering education in data structures, algorithms, cloud systems, and machine learning."}, {"course_id": "BIT-BE-ECE", "degree": "B.E. / B.Tech", "course_name": "B.E. in Electronics and Communication Engineering", "stream": "Engineering", "duration": "4 Years", "mode": "Full Time", "total_tuition_fee": "\u20b93,86,296", "seats": 180, "median_salary": "\u20b97.0 LPA", "eligibility": "10+2 with 45% in PCM + KCET / COMEDK", "overview": "Semiconductor electronics, microprocessors, wireless communication, and embedded DSP systems."}]}','https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/cd/Bangalore_Institute_of_Technology_logo.png/330px-Bangalore_Institute_of_Technology_logo.png','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562774053-701939374585?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','registrar@vtu.ac.in','State Apex Technological University (Affiliates 200+ Engineering Colleges across Karnataka)','Established under VTU Act 1994, Karnataka State Apex Technological University, UGC Act 12B Recognized, AICTE Approved','V.V. Puram City Campus',1,'https://maps.google.com/?q=Bangalore+Institute+of+Technology+VV+Puram','{"introduction": "Bangalore Institute of Technology (BIT) was established in 1979 under the aegis of the Rajya Vokkaligara Sangha. Located in the bustling heart of Bengaluru at V.V. Puram, BIT is celebrated for being the first college in Karnataka to introduce Computer Science Engineering.", "history": "Inaugurated in 1979 by the legendary engineer Dr. B. N. Garudachar, BIT has nurtured over 40,000 engineers who serve in major tech multinationals, public sector enterprises, and research organizations worldwide.", "vision": "To establish and develop the Institute as an acclaimed center of higher learning, imparting value-based technical education.", "mission": ["Offer quality education through competent faculty and modern technical infrastructure.", "Enhance research, consultancy, and industry interaction.", "Inculcate ethical values, leadership skills, and environmental responsibility."], "educational_philosophy": "Outcome-Based Education combining practical engineering training, coding sprints, and industry project internships.", "teaching_methodology": "Interactive classroom sessions, flipped labs, hands-on software development, and guest lectures from industry professionals.", "academic_environment": "Vibrant campus environment situated next to educational hubs and food streets of V.V. Puram, with active technical clubs like IEEE, CSI, and Rotaract."}','{"classrooms": {"available": true, "count": 92, "description": "Modern smart classrooms with digital projectors, audio systems, and internet connectivity."}, "science_labs": {"available": true, "count": 22, "description": "Equipped Physics, Chemistry, and Mechanical Workshop facilities."}, "computer_labs": {"available": true, "count": 32, "description": "Over 1,400 networked workstations with software suites for AI, cloud computing, and VLSI design."}, "library": {"available": true, "details": "Central automated library with 110,000+ volumes, IEEE digital access, and quiet reading areas."}, "digital_learning": {"available": true, "details": "Institutional LMS, digital repository, and virtual lab platforms."}, "sports": {"available": true, "details": "Indoor sports center for table tennis, chess, carrom, and access to shared athletic grounds."}, "auditorium": {"available": true, "count": 2, "details": "Ku. Vem. Pu. Auditorium seating 800 participants and seminar hall with videoconferencing."}, "cafeteria": {"available": true, "details": "Clean student cafeteria offering South Indian vegetarian snacks and meals."}, "medical_room": {"available": true, "details": "Campus infirmary with resident nurse and immediate tie-up with KIMS Hospital nearby."}, "internet": {"available": true, "speed": "1 Gbps high-speed leased line with campus Wi-Fi."}, "accessibility": {"available": true, "features": ["Wheelchair ramps at main entrance", "Lifts in all multi-floor blocks", "Accessible restrooms"]}, "security": {"available": true, "features": ["24/7 CCTV surveillance with 250+ cameras", "Gated campus security watch"]}}','{"available": true, "boys_capacity": 950, "girls_capacity": 600, "food_details": "Hygienic vegetarian dining hall serving wholesome South Indian meals.", "amenities": ["Wi-Fi access", "Solar hot water", "Study rooms", "Recreation hall"], "supervision": "Resident faculty wardens and 24/7 security personnel.", "contact_phone": "+91-80-2661-5870"}','{"available": false, "fleet_size": 0, "gps_enabled": false, "routes": [], "transport_coordinator": "Located in central Bengaluru (V.V. Puram) adjacent to National College Metro Station and city bus routes."}','{"academic_year": "2026-2027", "status": "Admissions Counseling Open", "eligibility_criteria": "Minimum 45% aggregate in 10+2 / 2nd PUC with Physics & Mathematics. Selection via KCET and COMEDK.", "process_steps": ["Step 1: Appear for KCET or COMEDK competitive entrance tests.", "Step 2: Participate in online counseling and select Bangalore Institute of Technology.", "Step 3: Document verification and admission fee payment.", "Step 4: Orientation and start of academic sessions."], "scholarships": ["Vokkaligara Sangha Merit-cum-Means Scholarships.", "Post-Matric Government of Karnataka SSP Scholarships.", "Alumni Endowment Aid."], "required_documents": ["KEA / COMEDK Allotment Order and Rank Card", "10th and 12th Marks Cards (Original)", "Transfer & Migration Certificates", "Study Certificate (7 years for KCET)", "Aadhaar Card and 4 Passport Photos"]}','Universities',12.9554,77.5752);
